      "title": "Method details",
      "instruction": "The first section will review the optimization model discussed in [1] which formulates the baseline SPSP that minimizes project cost and duration. We do a simple reformulation and add a new objective which will allow finding a schedule that will minimize also employee idle time while ensuring identical completion time of all projects. We then briefly discuss the random project generator discussed in [15] and the architecture of the program used which is interfaced to the online NEOS servers [14].",
